01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Raid on Rommel is a 1971 American war film directed by Henry Hathaway and starring Richard
Burton, John Colicos, Clinton Greyn, Danielle De Metz and Wolfgang Preiss.

11
01:12:36,000 --> 01:12:42,000
The film centers on a British commando attempting to
destroy German gun emplacements in Tobruk.

12
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:18,000
Originally intended as a made-for-television film, Raid on Rommel extensively reuses
action footage from 1967's Tobruk, and the storyline is also largely the same.

13
01:25:48,000 --> 01:25:54,000
The film was released by Universal Pictures on February 12, 1971,
and was both a critical and commercial failure.

14
01:32:24,000 --> 01:32:30,000
